m_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/773523458ac125752f9ba40fb8458c0f.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/b1996e8b9c0722aeea68a9a39ca1d23d.poster.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/b1996e8b9c0722aeea68a9a39ca1d23d.webm?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/b1996e8b9c0722aeea68a9a39ca1d23d.mp4?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lily is your girlfriend, but don't let her love fool you\u2014she's a nymphomaniac driven by an overwhelming need for control. Relentlessly chasing you down, she'll stop at nothing to pin you into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, Lily might seem playful and teasing, but don't be deceived. As the game progresses, Lily will become more relentless, aggressive, and aware of your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her playful taunts echo in your ear, daring you to escape, yet she closes the distance with fiery determination with every attempt. There's no escaping her insatiable hunger once she's set her sights on you.<br><br>Lily isn't just chasing you; she's toying with your emotions too. Be ready for unexpected shifts in her behavior, and don't fall for her sweet words\u2014no matter how convincing she may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/1dfdeba352b6c735eec260ff84cd4850.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ca2123eb67efaa8bb091789d651d22d6.poster.avif?t=1742849812\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ca2123eb67efaa8bb091789d651d22d6.webm?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ca2123eb67efaa8bb091789d651d22d6.mp4?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she hunts you down, you'll need to use every item that you can find\u2014like butt plugs or your trusty taser gun\u2014that might momentarily suppress her insatiable desire, but don't be fooled; it only holds her back for a while.<br><br>While trying to escape from Lily, you'll need to locate and activate three separate Butt Plugs scattered throughout your luxury apartment. These can only be used when Lily is unsuspecting and from behind, requiring you to be strategic and creative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/e7b68ab536231241a5a75dcec4d2ddd8.poster.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/e7b68ab536231241a5a75dcec4d2ddd8.webm?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/e7b68ab536231241a5a75dcec4d2ddd8.mp4?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, Lily guards the butt plug remote, which is secured with multiple keycards. To gain access, you'll need to unlock each one through door scanners before you can finally bring Lily under your control.  <br><br>Can you outwit her and regain control, showing her who's in charge, or will you succumb to her dominance? Lily's teasing and taunts will keep you on edge, daring you to run, but she's always just behind you, getting closer with every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/54da9dbc964a6f06efa0e43151e7fd85.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ee1de7e3ac61ab2dba8216c98310a320.poster.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ee1de7e3ac61ab2dba8216c98310a320.webm?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/ee1de7e3ac61ab2dba8216c98310a320.mp4?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more game completions, you'll unlock more delicious outfits to satiate your cravings. Latex, leather, stockings \u2013 you'll have it all to choose from: one sexy look after the next.  <br> <br>But Lily's Labyrinth of Lust doesn't stop there, and this game is fine-tuned for you. Change aspects of Lily's appearance for a maximized, intimately personal experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/6da23ac22dfe85bcb4257d29285915de.poster.avif?t=1742849812\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866440/extras/6da23ac22dfe85bcb4257d29285915de.webm?t=1742849812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.